            r'average pace of payroll job creation slowed to ([0-9,]+) per month in the second quarter.*?In (?:\\d{4} )?thus far, job growth has average[d]? ([0-9,]+)',
            r'average monthly gain of ([0-9,]+) jobs',
            r'pace of job creation averaged ([0-9,]+) per month in the first half of this year',
            r'pace of job creation averaged ([0-9,]+) per month during the first four months of this year',
